WEBVTT

00:04:27.221 --> 00:04:31.309
This is what burns
at the center of sports.

00:04:32.518 --> 00:04:36.022
In the Olympics, we have all agreed
a gold medal matters.

00:04:36.689 --> 00:04:38.399
Same with the World Cup.

00:04:39.233 --> 00:04:42.320
And now, paired with
these agreed-upon stakes,

00:04:42.361 --> 00:04:44.947
we also have -- at the Olympics
and the World Cup --

00:04:44.989 --> 00:04:46.657
very obvious storylines.

00:04:47.825 --> 00:04:50.494
One person has a USA jersey on,

00:04:50.494 --> 00:04:53.080
someone else has
a different country's jersey on.

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:54.332
Alright.

00:04:54.373 --> 00:04:57.543
We’ve got agreed-upon stakes,
we’ve got very obvious storylines --

00:04:57.543 --> 00:04:59.837
of course, now, we're going
to have a commitment

00:04:59.879 --> 00:05:01.255
to even deeper storytelling,